$('#scope-button').onclick=()=>{$('#detail-content').innerHTML='<div class="eyebrow">AN HONEST WORKING PREVIEW</div><h2>Built to explore the real workflow.</h2><p>This local POC supports projects, room upload, editable briefs, source research, evidence review, comparisons, image visualization requests, saved decisions, and gated seller handoff.</p><div class="truth-note">Search findings are leads unless exact variant and quantity evidence passes the server gate. Source access is partial. No direct Marketplace/Craigslist integration, continuous monitoring, client sharing, payments, purchase tracking, spoken playback, or multi-user accounts are implemented.</div><p>Room and product images are sent to the configured image provider only after consent and an explicit visualization request. Generated composites remain illustrative; product identity and measured fit need validation.</p><p>'+(state.auth?.mode==='cloud'?'Projects are stored in your private cloud workspace.':'Projects are stored locally on this server.')+' This is a development workspace, not a production privacy or security deployment.</p>';openDetail();};
